      "displayAnswer": "a) a\\sqrt7; b) -y\\sqrt{10}; c) 4x\\sqrt{x}; d) 0.1b^2\\sqrt{b}; e) 5a^3\\sqrt{2a}; f) -3c^3\\sqrt3. Each answer uses its given sign constraint.",
      "tasks": [
