      "displayAnswer": "a) \\sqrt{3a^2}, a>=0. b) -\\sqrt{3a^2}, a<0. c) \\sqrt{2x}, only for x>0. d) -\\sqrt{-2x}, only for x<0. In c) and d), x=0 remains excluded even though the transformed single-root expression alone can be evaluated there.",
      "tasks": [
