      "displayAnswer": "Exact rewrites and mathematical references only: a) \\sqrt{80}=4\\sqrt5, approximately 8.944271909999; b) \\sqrt{450}=15\\sqrt2, approximately 21.213203435596; c) \\sqrt{28}=2\\sqrt7, approximately 5.291502622129; d) \\sqrt{120}=2\\sqrt{30}, approximately 10.954451150103. These are NOT table readings. All four source-table procedures and rounded table values remain HOLD.",
