        {"label": "d", "input": "12\\sqrt{5/6}", "answer": "\\sqrt{120}=2\\sqrt{30}", "mathematical_reference": "10.954451150103", "reason": "12^2*(5/6)=144*5/6=120 exactly. Even-power scaling gives sqrt(120)=10sqrt(1.2); using 2 times a root of 30 is also exact. This avoids decimal truncation of 5/6.", "table_route_id": "830-d", "table_status": "HOLD"}
